WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:00.870
Hey kids!

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.130
Have you heard about this place?

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:04.050
Camels carry goods across the desert!

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.180
And the library keeps old stories safe!

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.850
And the mosques stand over it all.
